# TechEdge Core API — Quick Reference

## Authentication
All API calls require a Bearer token obtained via **Azure AD OAuth 2.0**.
Clients must register their Azure AD tenant ID with TechEdge IT before onboarding.

## Deployment
Production deploys on **every merge to main** (continuous deployment).
Deploys are automatic — the weekly Thursday 18:00 CET window has been 
deprecated as of August 2026. The `make release` target has been removed.

## Base URL
https://api.techedge.dk/v1

## Rate limits
100 requests/minute per client token.
